"author":{"id":1304009,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/e5/c9/36fdec8e.jpg","nickname":"liuq","note":"","ucode":"88437D66C547C4","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":652730,"discussion_content":"大哥，课程介绍里的群链接点不开了，群是多少，","content_length":22,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1729523234,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":1,"child_discussions":[{"author":{"id":1673990,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/8b/06/fb3be14a.jpg","nickname":"TableBear","note":"","ucode":"A2C0562EEA2725","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":1304009,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/e5/c9/36fdec8e.jpg","nickname":"liuq","note":"","ucode":"88437D66C547C4","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656398,"discussion_content":"我也不知道😂，没进群","content_length":10,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1737524568,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":652730,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":656398,"extra":""}]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":403841,"user_name":"唐龙","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1471657,"ip_address":"黑龙江","ucode":"87A10AE04F2037","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/74/a9/5eb3ebc6.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1765020815,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100311801,"comment_content":"75分。\n目前自己写的一个小项目，就是跟着这个课程一步一步完成的。小到什么程度，只有3个模块，8个实体，2个聚合，没有识别出限定，但我感觉更像是我对限定的理解有偏差。\n一提到DDD，很多人都会想到Java和微服务，我本职工作也确实是做了多年的Java和一点点的PHP，但是我并不认为DDD应该和语言绑的太死，我自己的小项目也是用C++语言的drogon框架完成的。\nC++上的一些处理：\n1. 非聚合根在Java中的setter要使用包级访问权限，让同包下的聚合根可以访问。C++没这种语法，但是我可以在非聚合根里把聚合根设置为友元类，再把不变成员变量设置为const，类似于不设置setter，非const成员可被友元类修改，类似于设置了包级私有的setter。\n2. 聚合根持有非聚合根对象，我用的是std::vector&lt;T&gt;，非聚合根再用const T&amp;指向聚合根。这一块设计主要是考虑到非聚合根对象不会同时被多个聚合根持有，完全没必要使用指针。另一点就是，聚合根的生命周期要长于非聚合根，所以非聚合根直接使用引用来访问聚合根。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":384357,"user_name":"江南烟雨中","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1336475,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"C4D98DFDBF7584","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/64/9b/a029ca39.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1700728745,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100311801,"comment_content":"80分，X*4","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":371421,"user_name":"Mr.H","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1562855,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"035F78476138C0","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/d8/e7/21a4cbb1.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1679915194,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100311801,"comment_content":"85，看错了一题多选选反了😂","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":370249,"user_name":"　","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1267107,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"246CD8612E84EA","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/55/a3/88cbb981.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1678606930,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100311801,"comment_content":"85，算是学的认真的课了。追更太慢，学得不过瘾，甚至买了原书和《实现领域驱动设计》读完了。","like_count":0}]}